      "text": "those who embark in service of God must serve him with whole heart, D&C 4:2. those who desire to serve God are called, D&C 4:3. the Lord gave commandments that people should love and serve him, D&C 20:19. sanctification to all who love and serve God, D&C 20:31. determination to serve the Lord to end is required for baptism, D&C 20:37. devote all thy service in Zion, D&C 24:7. if thou lovest me, thou shalt serve me, D&C 42:29 (59:5). bishop’s counselors to receive remuneration for services, D&C 42:72. serve God in name of Jesus Christ, D&C 59:5. the Lord delights to honor those who serve him in righteousness, D&C 76:5.",
